    "SI conversions applied: m\u03a9 to ohm, pF to F, \u00b5A to A, nC to C, and ns to s where represented.",
    "The strict extraction schema has no fields for gate charge, reverse-recovery charge/time, thermal resistance, IDSS, or gate resistance; those datasheet values were not inserted into unrelated fields."
